controlled tool workflow,

33
00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:14.583
but the capstone does not borrow that
authority. Good scope

34
00:03:14.583 --> 00:03:20.000
preserves meaningful reasoning while
removing unnecessary consequence.

35
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:26.429
Build a workflow plan another person can
follow. Separate instructions,

36
00:03:26.429 --> 00:03:32.857
trusted evidence, untrusted input,
constraints, and the output contract.

37
00:03:32.857 --> 00:03:39.286
Identify the provider or tool surface from
